{
  "meta": {
    "site": "https://github.com/zengfr/n8n-workflow-all-templates",
    "tokenfree": "https://tokenyep.com/",
    "name": "Send UK hiring-signal leads from Apify to Instantly.ai campaigns and Google Sheets",
    "wechat": "youandme10086",
    "id": 18786,
    "update_time": "2026-09-27"
  },
  "name": "Actor 01B — Hiring Signal → Instantly Campaign + Google Sheets Log",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "01b00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -500,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 1329,
        "content": "## 📇 Hiring Signal → Instantly Campaign + Google Sheets Log\nThis workflow runs weekly, triggers the Hiring Signal Lead Scraper Apify Actor to find companies posting relevant hiring signals in the UK, formats the verified leads, and pushes them into an Instantly.ai cold email campaign while logging every lead to Google Sheets for tracking.\n\n### What this workflow does\n- Fires every Sunday at 11pm on a schedule trigger\n- Runs the Hiring Signal Lead Scraper Apify Actor and waits up to 300s for it to finish\n- Fetches the resulting dataset of scraped leads from Apify\n- Filters to leads with a verified email and formats fields (name, company, hiring role, source) for Instantly.ai\n- Splits leads into batches of 10 to avoid rate limits\n- Adds each batch of leads to an Instantly.ai campaign with a personalised opening line\n- Logs every lead added to a Google Sheet in parallel for a running record\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Replace YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN in the 'Run Hiring Signal Actor' and 'Fetch Dataset Results' nodes with your Apify API token.\n2. Replace YOUR_INSTANTLY_API_KEY and YOUR_INSTANTLY_CAMPAIGN_ID in the 'Add to Instantly Campaign' node with values from your Instantly.ai dashboard.\n3. Replace YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID in the 'Log to Google Sheets' node with your spreadsheet ID (found in the sheet URL).\n4. Create Google Sheets OAuth2 credentials in n8n and attach them to the 'Log to Google Sheets' node.\n5. Create a sheet tab named 'Hiring Signal Leads' with columns: Email, First Name, Last Name, Company, Hiring Signal, Source, Lead Score, Date Added.\n\n### Customization\nAdjust the `jobTitleKeywords` and `locations` in the actor run body to target different roles or geographies, and tune the personalisation line in 'Add to Instantly Campaign' to match your outbound voice."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "01b00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Fetch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        180,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 700,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## 1. Schedule & fetch leads\nTriggers weekly, runs the Hiring Signal Apify Actor, and pulls the resulting dataset."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "01b00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000011",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        860,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## 2. Format & batch leads\nFilters to verified emails, maps fields for Instantly.ai, and splits into batches of 10."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "01b00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000012",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Deliver",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1300,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 340,
        "height": 400,
        "content": "## 3. Deliver to campaign & log\nAdds leads to the Instantly.ai campaign and logs each one to Google Sheets in parallel."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "01b00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Every Sunday 11pm",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 23 * * 0"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "01b00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Run Hiring Signal Actor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/conceivable_extension~hiring-signal-lead-scraper/runs",
        "body": {
          "sources": [
            "indeed",
            "linkedin",
            "greenhouse",
            "lever",
            "workable"
          ],
          "locations": [
            "United Kingdom"
          ],
          "enrichWithEmails": true,
          "jobTitleKeywords": [
            "Head of Operations",
            "VP Sales",
            "Digital Transformation Manager",
            "Revenue Operations Manager",
            "Head of Growth",
            "Sales Director",
            "Marketing Director"
          ],
          "postedWithinDays": 7,
          "maxResultsPerSource": 30
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "sendBody": true,
        "sendQuery": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN"
            },
            {
              "name": "waitForFinish",
              "value": "300"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.1
    },
    {
      "id": "01b00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Fetch Dataset Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.apify.com/v2/datasets/{{ $json.defaultDatasetId }}/items",
        "method": "GET",
        "options": {},
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN"
            },
            {
              "name": "format",
              "value": "json"
            },
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "200"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.1
    },
    {
      "id": "01b00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Format for Instantly",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Format leads for Instantly.ai campaign\nconst raw = $input.first().json;\nconst leads = Array.isArray(raw) ? raw : [raw];\n\nreturn leads\n  .filter(lead => lead.emailStatus === 'valid' && lead.email)\n  .map(lead => ({\n    json: {\n      // Instantly.ai required fields\n      email: lead.email,\n      first_name: lead.firstName || (lead.contactName || '').split(' ')[0] || '',\n      last_name: lead.lastName || (lead.contactName || '').split(' ').slice(1).join(' ') || '',\n      company_name: lead.companyName || lead.company || '',\n      // Custom variables for personalisation tokens\n      hiring_role: lead.postedRole || lead.jobTitle || '',\n      job_board: lead.source || '',\n      job_posting_url: lead.jobPostingUrl || '',\n      // For Google Sheets logging\n      lead_score: lead.leadScore || 0,\n      added_date: new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]\n    }\n  }));"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "01b00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Split into Batches",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "position": [
        1120,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "batchSize": 10
      },
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "01b00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
      "name": "Add to Instantly Campaign",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        1340,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.instantly.ai/api/v1/lead/add",
        "body": {
          "leads": [
            {
              "email": "={{ $json.email }}",
              "last_name": "={{ $json.last_name }}",
              "first_name": "={{ $json.first_name }}",
              "company_name": "={{ $json.company_name }}",
              "personalization": "I noticed {{ $json.company_name }} recently posted a {{ $json.hiring_role }} role — that usually signals a specific operational gap. Happy to share how similar companies have solved it."
            }
          ],
          "api_key": "YOUR_CREDENTIAL_HERE",
          "campaign_id": "YOUR_INSTANTLY_CAMPAIGN_ID",
          "skip_if_in_workspace": true
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.1
    },
    {
      "id": "01b00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
      "name": "Log to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        1340,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {
            "Email": "={{ $json.email }}",
            "Source": "={{ $json.job_board }}",
            "Company": "={{ $json.company_name }}",
            "Last Name": "={{ $json.last_name }}",
            "Date Added": "={{ $json.added_date }}",
            "First Name": "={{ $json.first_name }}",
            "Lead Score": "={{ $json.lead_score }}",
            "Hiring Signal": "={{ $json.hiring_role }}"
          },
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow"
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Hiring Signal Leads"
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "credential-id",
          "name": "Google Sheets OAuth2"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "versionId": "actor01b-v1",
  "connections": {
    "Every Sunday 11pm": {
